    <value>In addition to the above, you will be entitled to an employer's contribution of 11% of your basic salary towards the pension scheme of the Government. You will be given gratuity as per the Federal Democracy of Ethiopia Pension Proclamation 715/2003 for Private Organization Employees and the other terms and conditions will be effected as per the Human Resource Policy of the company. Please also note that you will be governed by the rules and regulations of the Company put in place from time to time. You will be on probation for a period of &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;60&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; working days during which time your performance will be appraised. You will be confirmed on the job upon satisfactory performance. Unsatisfactory performance will result in termination of your employment during or at the end of the probation period. Termination of employment can be initiated by {Fields.Name} or yourself. In regards with prior notice both parties are governed by the labor proclamation 1156/2011. Welcome to {Fields.Name}, I look forward to work with you and your efficient and effective performance.</value>
